{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"b300d2a00ef4238c256f8a9d29bc0a1d295803bb4dc8e9a92c0dd26615335564","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["祭司用的厢房"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那人带我出了圣殿，向北来到外院的厢房，一排在空地对面，一排在北边的建筑物对面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["厢房长五十米，宽二十五米，有北门。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["内院十米宽的空地对面和外院的铺石地对面有三层走廊，彼此相对。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["在两排厢房之间有一条五米宽、五十米长的通道，厢房的门都向北。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["上层的厢房比下层和中层的窄，因为上层走廊占去较大的面积。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["这建筑物不像外院那样有柱子，所以上层比中层和下层窄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["厢房旁边有道外墙与厢房及外院平行，长二十五米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["靠近外院的厢房长二十五米，靠近圣殿的厢房则长五十米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["下层厢房的东面有一道门，可以从外院进入。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["南面",{"noteId":6},"的院墙有两排厢房，一排在空地对面，一排在南面的建筑物对面，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["厢房前面有通道。这些厢房与北面的厢房一样，长宽相同，出入口和结构也一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["南厢房的门也和北面的一样，厢房东面通道的前端有一道门可以进入。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他对我说：“这些在南北两面对着圣殿空地的厢房都是圣洁的，供事奉耶和华的祭司在那里吃至圣的祭物，并放置素祭、赎罪祭和赎过祭等至圣的祭物，因为这是圣洁的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["祭司在圣所供职后，不可直接到外院，要先在这些厢房里脱下供职时所穿的圣衣，换上普通衣服，才可以到外面的百姓那里。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["他量完圣殿里面，便带我出了东门，量圣殿外围。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他用量竿量了东面，长二百五十米；"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["又量了北面，长二百五十米；"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["又量了南面，长二百五十米；"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["然后又去量西面，长二百五十米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["他量了圣殿的四围，四围有一道墙，长宽都是二百五十米，这墙是为了把圣地和俗地隔开。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"“南面”希伯来文是“东面”。","reference":{"chapter":42,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/43.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}